c9-990b-91b38db09e67\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Enable billboarding on a node that can, (presumably only on AMD with the current driver version)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n- N/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113602/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113602/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}